meta {
  name: 01-Browse listings (anonymous, before signing up)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/listings?page=0&size=20
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Before I even register I want to scope out the platform. Are there
  PH listings here? Who's already on it? I'm sizing up whether this is
  worth my time.

  As an agent, what I REALLY want to know — "how many listings on this
  platform need an agent?" There's no filter for that. I'm flying blind.
}
